LabCairn — third-party notices
===============================================================================

Applies to: the `labcairn` 0.1.0 source distribution and wheel; the npm
dependency tree of the desktop shell (`shell/package.json`, pinned by
`shell/pnpm-lock.yaml`); the binaries the NSIS installer distributes
(`$PLUGINSDIR` plug-ins and `elevate.exe`, §2.5); and the npm dependency
tree of the web front end (`web/package.json`, pinned by
`web/pnpm-lock.yaml`, §2.6).

§0.1 names every surface a LabCairn distribution carries and what each one
carries with it. The installer binaries and the web tree were outside this
file until 2026-11-12, and their absence is what made the scope of this
notice narrower than the product it describes.

Measured: 2026-10-25, by building the artefacts (`uv build`), reading their
member lists and their bytes, and reading the licence of every installed
dependency out of its own installed distribution metadata. The dependency
figures below come from the `uv.lock` at commit dd08573.

Re-measured 2026-11-11 on this tree, because the two anchors above are older
than the tree: `uv.lock` changed after `dd08573` (certifi `2026.7.22` →
`2026.10.23`, and `httpx` became a declared dependency), and `src/labcairn`
grew. The §1 member counts, §2.1's declared-dependency table, §2.2's closure
counts and licence census, and all of §2.4 are re-measured, each against the
revision named in its own section; §§3 and 4 name the third-party files they
describe and were not re-opened. Every re-measured figure says which revision it
was taken at, and each of those revisions was printed by `git rev-parse HEAD`.

Every number in this file was measured rather than remembered. §5 gives the
commands that reproduce them.


